"See `basis sets for explicitly correlated methods "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#basis-sets>`__ for examples when using "
"explicitly correlated methods."
msgstr ""
"有关使用显式相关方法时的示例，请参阅 `显式相关方法的基组 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#basissets>`__\\ 。"
